('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a bistable multivibrator?',ARRAY['Two stable states (flip-flop)','No stable state','One stable state','Free-running'],0,'Bistable = SR flip-flop.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a 555 timer?',ARRAY['Versatile IC for timing and oscillation','Op-amp','Comparator','Logic gate'],0,'555 timer: astable, monostable, PWM applications.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the output frequency of a 555 astable?',ARRAY['f = 1.44/((RA+2RB)C)','f = RC','f = 1/(RC)','f = RA+RB'],0,'555 astable: f = 1.44/((RA+2RB)×C).',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the duty cycle of a 555 astable?',ARRAY['(RA+RB)/(RA+2RB) × 100%','50%','100%','RB/RA'],0,'Duty cycle depends on RA and RB ratio.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a PLL (Phase-Locked Loop)?',ARRAY['Locks output phase to input reference','Phase shifter','Frequency multiplier only','Filter'],0,'PLL: phase detector + VCO + loop filter.',20),
