('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the capture range of a PLL?',ARRAY['Range of frequencies PLL can lock onto','Output frequency range','Input voltage range','Loop bandwidth'],0,'Capture range ⊆ lock range.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the lock range of a PLL?',ARRAY['Range of frequencies PLL can maintain lock','Capture range','VCO range','Filter bandwidth'],0,'Lock range ≥ capture range.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a VCO?',ARRAY['Voltage-Controlled Oscillator','Voltage Comparator','Variable Current Output','Voltage Controlled Op-amp'],0,'VCO frequency controlled by input voltage.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a sample-and-hold circuit?',ARRAY['Captures and holds analog voltage','Amplifies signal','Filters signal','Converts digital to analog'],0,'S/H uses a capacitor to hold sampled voltage.',20),
