('circuit-builder','advanced','What is an ADC?',ARRAY['Analog-to-Digital Converter','Amplifier with Digital Control','Active Differential Comparator','Analog Data Converter'],0,'ADC converts analog voltage to digital code.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the resolution of an 8-bit ADC?',ARRAY['256 levels','128 levels','64 levels','512 levels'],0,'2^8 = 256 levels.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the quantization error of an n-bit ADC?',ARRAY['±(1/2) LSB','±1 LSB','±2 LSB','±(1/4) LSB'],0,'Quantization error is ±½ LSB.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a flash ADC?',ARRAY['Fastest ADC using 2^n-1 comparators','Slowest ADC','Uses a single comparator','Uses a DAC'],0,'Flash ADC: parallel comparison, 1 clock cycle.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a successive approximation ADC?',ARRAY['Uses binary search with DAC','Uses parallel comparators','Uses single slope','Uses dual slope'],0,'SAR ADC: binary search, n clock cycles.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a dual-slope ADC?',ARRAY['Integrates signal for fixed time, then deintegrates','Uses parallel comparators','Uses binary search','Fastest ADC'],0,'Dual-slope: high accuracy, slow speed.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is a sigma-delta ADC?',ARRAY['Oversampling + noise shaping + decimation','Parallel conversion','Binary search','Dual slope'],0,'Σ-Δ ADC: high resolution, moderate speed.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is the Nyquist rate?',ARRAY['Minimum sampling rate = 2 × signal bandwidth','Sampling rate = signal bandwidth','Sampling rate = 4 × bandwidth','Sampling rate = bandwidth/2'],0,'Nyquist: fs ≥ 2 × fmax to avoid aliasing.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is aliasing?',ARRAY['High frequencies fold back as low frequencies','Signal attenuation','Signal amplification','Phase distortion'],0,'Aliasing occurs when fs < 2 × fmax.',20),
('circuit-builder','advanced','What is an anti-aliasing filter?',ARRAY['Low-pass filter before ADC','High-pass filter after ADC','Band-pass filter','Notch filter'],0,'Anti-aliasing filter limits bandwidth before sampling.',20),
